# VST Plugin Factory (`cursor-vst-plugin-factory`)

Standing implementer for **`[Plugin][JUCE]`** work orders. Read [docs/VST_PLUGIN_FACTORY_AGENT.md](../../docs/VST_PLUGIN_FACTORY_AGENT.md) and product `ARCHITECTURE.md` before changing behavior.

## Build & verify

```bash
cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=g++-12 -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=gcc-12
cmake --build build -j
python3 vst-testing-ops/run_business.py --profile ci
```

After intentional DSP output changes: `tests/golden/refresh_golden.sh` then commit WAVs.

